<title>NETHERLANDS: Oce 1996/97 first quarter net up 62 pct.</title>
<headline>Oce 1996/97 first quarter net up 62 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First qtr to Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.13 vs   1.68</p>
<p>    Net profit			    44.3  vs  27.4</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			1.16 vs   0.75</p>
<p>    Income from financial leases    32.1  vs  29.2</p>
<p>    Total turnover (billion)	   1.20 vs   0.77</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    87.2  vs  57.7</p>
<p>    Tax				     13.8  vs   6.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected copier maker Oce-van der Grinten NV to report a net profit of 40 million to 51 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
